            "review_title": "Review at Pizza Inn & Huy Cafe",
            "review_text": "Sarah B\nCotati, California33 contributions\n0\nAverage\nAug 2013 • Couples\nGot a pizza and a pasta for dinner. The pizza was ok, nothing to write home about. It was very small and would probably not be enough for one really hungry person. The pasta was better, but also a pretty small portion. I guess if you are desperate for an Italian food fix this place will suffice, but this is in no way a family style Italian restaurant.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 14, 2013",
