            "review_title": "Review at Pizza Inn & Huy Cafe",
            "review_text": "Amelia W\nToronto, Canada12 contributions\n0\nGreat value for the location\nFeb 2013 • Couples\nThis review is based on value for the location and this restaurant nails it. We looked at many menus in and around the area and this place was one of the cheapest, but the food is A-OK! Lots of veggies and meat with the stir fries (60000-80000 dong), and the pizza is pretty decent too albiet a little small (90000-105000 dong). We have eaten here twice already and will return for more! If you sit on the balcony you have a nice view of the street.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 11, 2013",
